# Mutable ECR tags: repo currently uses a moving :latest tag for the
# deploy pipeline. Same tradeoff as checkov's CKV_AWS_51.
AVD-AWS-0031

# S3 state bucket uses default AES256 (SSE-S3), not a customer-managed
# KMS key. Same tradeoff as checkov's CKV_AWS_145.
AVD-AWS-0132

# The ALB is deliberately public — it's the entrypoint for a public web
# app. Same as checkov's implicit acceptance of this design.
AVD-AWS-0053

# Unrestricted egress on the ALB/ECS-service/vpc-endpoint security
# groups: standard "allow all outbound" pattern, needed for ECR pulls,
# CloudWatch logs, and general AWS API access. Tightening every one of
# these to exact destination CIDRs would need AWS service prefix lists
# per resource — a substantial redesign out of scope here.
AVD-AWS-0104
